---
import GuideLayout from '../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
import FilterableTable from '../components/FilterableTable.astro';

const rows = [
  [
    "（不填具体字符串——待核）",
    "（待核）",
    "（待核——禁止编造）",
    "reported",
    "2026-10-24",
    ""
  ],
  [
    "（不填具体字符串——待核）",
    "（待核）",
    "（待核）",
    "reported",
    "2026-10-24",
    ""
  ]
];
---
<GuideLayout title="MW4 Stranded Codes" lang="zh-CN">
  <div slot="definition">
    <p>本表收录与 MW4 / DMZ <strong>Stranded codes</strong> 相关的代码或标签、使用场景与效果摘要。</p>
    <p><strong>不保证可用</strong>：未核实代码一律 <code>reported</code> 或整行不写。</p>
    <p><strong>禁止</strong>在草稿中填写具体代码字符串。</p>
  </div>
  <div slot="how-to">
    <ol>
      <li>只添加带 Sources 的行；无来源不进表。</li>
      <li>读者应假设 <code>reported</code> 行可能失效、分区或已过期。</li>
      <li><strong>筛选项（实现时）：</strong> Code / label · Where used · Status。</li>
      <li>回 <a href="/dmz-mw4/">/dmz-mw4</a>。</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div slot="body">
    <p><strong>筛选项（产品实现时挂上）：</strong> Code / label · Where used · Status</p>
    <FilterableTable
      columns={["Code / label", "Where used", "Effect summary", "Status", "Last verified", "Sources"]}
      caption="MW4 Stranded Codes — 待核行模板，无已核游戏数据"
      id="mw4-stranded-codes"
      rows={rows}
      note={"定义声明：本页不保证任何代码可用；上线前若仍无一手来源，可保留空表 + 本声明，优于粘贴社区未核列表。"}
    />
  </div>
  <div slot="sources">
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>Sources and update dates</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr id="source-1"><td>1</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/modernwarfare4/dmz">Official MW4 DMZ</a></td><td>2026-10-24</td><td>模式口径；Stranded / 代码机制是否官方点名待核</td></tr>
          <tr id="source-2"><td>2</td><td>（待补）可复现一手或官方补丁说明</td><td>—</td><td>无一手则不把社区列表标 <code>confirmed</code></td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>Sources: <a href="#source-1">[1]</a></p>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
